=== layout: one-panel

# Common SNP Patterns for ABO Blood Types

@body

| rs8176719 | rs8176746 | rs8176747 | Blood type |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| D;D | Any | Any | O |
| D;I or I;I | C;C | G;G | A |
| D;I or I;I | A;A | C;C | B |
| D;I | A;C | C;G | B |
| I;I | A;C | C;G | AB |

